**WS1 REQUEST_CHANGES — two findings, both reproduced empirically:**
1. **Bare acks escalate to Opus.** `ReviewVerdict/ACK`, `ChallengeThread/ACK`, and `ChallengeThread/RESOLVE` all return OPUS because `_OPUS_TYPES` keys on type alone while `_CHEAP` only whitelists `Ticket` acks. This directly fails the measurable AC "zero Opus on bare acks" — and those ack types dominate this very epic's traffic. Fix: ACK/STATUS_ACK/NOTE/RESOLVE must never escalate.
